• WASD or Arrow Keys - Move player

[b]ABILITIES[/b]
• SPACE - Slowdown ability (drains meter)

[b]GAME CONTROLS[/b]
• ESC - Pause game
• L - Load MP3 files (main menu)

[b]GAMEPLAY[/b]
Dodge bullets synced to your music!
• [color=#ff5555]Red (Bass)[/color] - Heavy, slow X pattern
• [color=#55ff55]Green (Mid)[/color] - Normal, 8-way star
• [color=#5599ff]Blue (High)[/color] - Fast, circular spread

Survive longer to build your combo multiplier!"
